    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
Trade enough {p:Crystals} to the {p:Conquest NPC} to raise your Rank bar and unlock the Mission, then accept it from the {n:Gate Guard}.
* Zone into {z:Northern San d'Oria} for a __lengthy__ cutscene.
** If you accepted the Mission from the {z:Northern San d'Oria} gate guard, you can talk to {n:Arnau} to see they are still preparing the Rites.
** You will be prohibited from zoning into {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} due to increased security until you've triggered the cutscene in {z:Northern San d'Oria}.
* Zone into {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} for a cutscene.
* Head to {z:Fei'Yin} for a cutscene.
* Make your way to {z:Qu'Bia Arena} for a two-part BCNM fight, "**The Heir to the Light**".
** Use {z:Fei'Yin} {p:Home Point} #1 or {n:Domenic} to teleport right outside the arena, then walk a short distance to zone into the small room with the **Burning Circle**.
* Part One will have {m:Death Clan Destroyer} ({p:WHM} {p:Warmachine|Category:Orcish Warmachine}), {m:Yukvok of Clan Death} (Unsleepable {m:Orc} {p:RNG}), 3 {m:Worgbut of Clan Death}, 3 {m:Rallbrog of Clan Death}, and 3 {m:Vangknok of Clan Death} ({m:Orcs|Orc}, Sleepable).
** Open with {p:Elemental Seal}+{s:Sleepga II} or {s:Horde Lullaby}, and start attacking the Ranger mob first. Make sure you silence the Warmachine, as it is a WHM who can Curaga and wake everything up. Defeat the Ranger, followed by the Warmachine, and then take our the rest.
** Sleep the last mob before killing it, and give yourself a rest. There will be no time after the first part of the fight to rest.
* Part Two will include {p:Prince Trion} fighting by your side, against 3 {m:Orc} NMs, {m:Warlord Rojgnoj} ({p:PLD} unsleepable), {m:Rojgnoj's Left Hand} ({p:BLM}), and {m:Rojgnoj's Right Hand} ({p:DRK}).
** Trion will randomly attack a mob, and should be helped. Preferably, the order to kill the NMs is BLM > PLD > DRK. Trion can be cured and can die in the BC. Should he die, you will be ejected from the BC. Despite being a Paladin, he isn't great at keeping himself alive.
** Keep the other mobs silenced, a Paladin with {p:Invincible} is useful here for keeping attention.
* Upon clearing the battlefield, zone into {z:Northern San d'Oria} for a cutscene.
* Head to the {z:Chateau|Chateau d'Oraguille} and check the **Great Hall** door for another cutscene.
* Make your way to (H-8) in {z:King Ranperre's Tomb} and check the **Heavy Stone Door** -- the same from a previous {M:mission|San d'Oria Mission 6-2|Ranperre's Final Rest} -- for yet another cutscene.
* Go back to the {z:Chateau|Chateau d'Oraguille} and speak to {p:Halver} and you will receive your rewards.
** **(Optional)**: Exit to {z:Northern San d'Oria} and proceed to the **Papal Chamber door**.
* Zone into {z:Southern San d'Oria} for a final epilogue cutscene!

